    "title": "Men's Soccer Falls At Mary Baldwin - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago (STAUNTON, Va.) – The final men's soccer non-conference game of the season saw Wilson fall to Mary Baldwin on the pitch Tuesday afternoon. Jordan DeVincent (Sr., Eldersburg, Md. / Liberty) was able to find the back of the net for the Phoenix as an answer to a pair of goals by the Fighting Squirrels late in the first half, but MBU was able to add an insurance goal in the second half while keeping the Blue and White at bay in the second. Read full article",
